{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNeAyVyP17fBhv2tj6EE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change does what T2 asks and nothing it forbids.\n\n- **Overdraw:** `remove` now raises `ValueError` when `qty` is greater than the stock for that SKU. An unknown SKU counts as 0 in stock, so any positive removal from it is refused.\n- **Refused removal:** the check runs before any mutation, so a refused removal leaves the stock unchanged.\n- **Exact removal:** removing exactly the quantity in stock passes the check and leaves 0.\n- **Unknown SKU:** `self._stock[sku] -= qty` can't hit a `KeyError`, because an unknown SKU always fails the check first.\n- **Existing behaviour:** the `qty <= 0` check is unchanged.\n\nI only read the task and the diff; I didn't run any tests. The change adds no tests, but the task doesn't ask for any.\n\nWIP-REVIEW WIP-NONCE:f74fa85ef145fc63 2cb64d20c35f6fa7f8551819d4ea221d15727533 approve\n\nOPEN_FLEET_WORKER_DONE disp_04e450f63d succeeded"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":17705,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6311f02b-e3b9-4173-a7d6-43d162f89435","uuid":"058a41c6-fcc2-4eea-adf8-7359fe2787f1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:29:53.284Z","request_id":"req_011CgNeAyBNGJRwQ4Z5ocLUP"}
